==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|werien|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|warjaną|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/veːɐ̯n/|/ˈveːʀən/|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|eːʀən|lang=de}}

===Verb===
'''wehren'''

# to [[defend]]
#: ''Ich wollte mich doch nur wehren.'' - I only tried to defend myself.
#: ''Wehret den Anfängen!'' - Beware of the beginnings!

